<title>UK: UK says design of tunnel trains will be examined.</title>
<headline>UK says design of tunnel trains will be examined.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport Secretary Sir George Young said on Tuesday the Channel Tunnel Safety Authority (CTSA) would want to re-examine the design of Eurotunnel's shuttle trains once investigations have been completed into the fire that damaged the tunnel on Monday night.</p>
</text>
